WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:00.300
[Low, atmospheric music]

00:00.300 --> 00:07.020
ALFRED: Someone has seized the Wayne defence network.
Armed aircraft are moving inland from the docks.

00:08.900 --> 00:10.990
BATMAN: I'm on it, keep those people moving.

00:15.500 --> 00:20.960
GORDON: The override is accepted, heat is restored
and our people are safe.
